        <ARI_DefSource>Filippi and Rocca 2020; https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-38621-4_5; Tenembaum 2002; https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/12391351/</ARI_DefSource>
