        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Pityriasis Lichenoides Chronica (PLC) - Milder, chronic form with scaly, reddish-brown papules.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Pityriasis Lichenoides et Varioliformis Acuta (PLEVA) - Sudden onset of red papules that evolve into vesicles or ulcers.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
