        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Healthline | https://www.healthline.com/health/graves-disease</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Mayo Clinic | https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/graves-disease/symptoms-causes/syc-20356240</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Thyroid and Graves’ Disease Unmasked | http://www.gravesdiseaseunmasked.com/blog/</ARI_RefLink>
