        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>GBS, Acute Inflammatory Demyelinating Polyneuropathy (AIDP) - Most common form, affects myelin.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>GBS, Acute Motor Axonal Neuropathy (AMAN) - Predominantly affects motor neurons.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
