        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Herpes Gestationis, Early-Onset - Appears in the first or second trimester.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Herpes Gestationis, Late-Onset - Develops in the third trimester or postpartum.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
