        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Primary ITP - Not associated with another condition</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Secondary ATP - Associated with a non-autoimmune condition (e.g., H pylori, HIV)</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
