        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Healthline | https://www.healthline.com/health/lupus/vasculitis-and-lupus</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Lupus Foundation of America | https://www.lupus.org/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Lupus Research Alliance | https://www.lupusresearch.org/stay-informed/community/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Lupus and Allied Diseases Association | https://www.ladainc.org/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>National Lupus Patient Registry | https://www.lupus.org/national-lupus-patient-registry</ARI_RefLink>
