        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>MOGAD, Monophasic - Single episode of demyelination.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>MOGAD, Relapsing - Multiple episodes over time.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
