        <ARI_DefSource>Flanagan 2019; https://onlinelibrary.ectrims-congress.eu/ectrims/2019/stockholm/278755/eoin.flanagan.the.epidemiology.of.myelin.oligodendrocyte.glycoprotein.antibody.html</ARI_DefSource>
