        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Ophthalmoplegia, Mild - Eye movement restriction without vision loss.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Ophthalmoplegia, Severe - Progressive vision-threatening involvement.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
