        <ARI_RefLink>European group on Graves’ orbitopathy | http://www.eugogo.eu/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Graves’ Disease &amp; Thyroid Foundation | https://www.gdatf.org/</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Cleveland Clinic | https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/17558-thyroid-eye-disease</ARI_RefLink>
        <ARI_RefLink>Link to Healthline | https://www.healthline.com/health/graves-disease-eyes</ARI_RefLink>
