        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Psoriasis, Guttate - Small, drop-like lesions.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Psoriasis, Inverse - Affects folds like armpits.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
