        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Lupus Nephritis, Class III (Focal) - Scattered inflammation with possible kidney function loss.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Lupus Nephritis, Class IV (Diffuse) - Severe kidney damage.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
        <ARI_ClinicalSubtype>Lupus Nephritis, Class V (Membranous) - Protein leakage in urine.</ARI_ClinicalSubtype>
